# Minecraft before 1.21 (Forge builds 1.20.2 - 1.20.6). After below-1.21.2: the frame partial tick is a float
# (DeltaTracker stand-in in src/legacy/pre-delta-tracker), BufferBuilder owns its ByteBuffer (src/legacy/pre-byte-buffer-builder).
net.minecraft.client.DeltaTracker com.elfmcys.ysm.legacy.DeltaTracker
regex	\.getTimer\(\)\s*\.getGameTimeDeltaPartialTick\([^()]*\)	.getFrameTime()
